"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"REALIA:9.7\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">9.7</span> 标题：酸奶、奶酪、凝乳（yogurt, curds）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：חֶמְאָה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：chem’ah)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01018008\" data-end-ref=\"01018008\">GEN 18:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05032014\" data-end-ref=\"05032014\">DEU 32:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07005025\" data-end-ref=\"07005025\">JDG 5:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10017029\" data-end-ref=\"10017029\">2SA 17:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18020017\" data-end-ref=\"18020017\">JOB 20:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19055022\" data-end-ref=\"19055022\">PSA 55:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20030033\" data-end-ref=\"20030033\">PRO 30:33</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23007015\" data-end-ref=\"23007015\">ISA 7:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23007022\" data-end-ref=\"23007022\">ISA 7:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23007022\" data-end-ref=\"23007022\">ISA 7:22</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：חֵמָה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：chemah)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18029006\" data-end-ref=\"18029006\">JOB 29:6</data></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>酸奶是一种半固态的食物，由细菌使牛奶凝结而成。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>希伯来文<em>chem’ah</em> 的译法差别很大。在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23007015\" data-end-ref=\"23007015\">ISA 7:15</data> ，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 忽略了酸化的过程，将这个词译为“milk”（“牛奶”），而<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New Century Version\">NCV</abbr> 译为“milk curds”（“凝乳”），目标读者大概不太了解这是什么东西。<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> 译成“yogurt”（“酸奶”）更好一些。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
